    {
      "id": "39ddbaa4-906a-43be-88dc-8a9cda1db7a5",
      "content": "English: Asshur | French: Assour | Latin: Assur | Origin: &#1488;&#1463;&#64298;&#1468;&#64309;&#1512; | Vietnamese: Át-sua 1 -- Dòng dõi ông Sêm, St 10,22",
